    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valerie is a 2D adventure game by Jole that mixes lively retro-inspired platforming with a personal story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/1d9f76d281eb132cc793e353f275c1ec.avif?t=1755131282\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Unbound Mind\u00a0</i>was a book that sparked great controversy; many who read it mistakenly believed it had opened their mind to paranormal powers. Very few truly grasped its rigorous teachings, but from those who did, <strong>The Unbound Society</strong> was formed - a small elite group with ambitious ideals and intent to impose greater order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows a girl named Valerie who was able to attain these powers, but was separate from those ideals. Her mother, wishing to realise the high expectations she had for her daughter, discovers\u00a0<strong>The Unbound Society</strong>, and takes her to them in the hope that they can light the way to Valerie's future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d6577e2b0c64a6f5049681650d4fa720.avif?t=1755131282\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her powers aren't all that useful for fighting, but they're fun! Use the <strong>boost</strong> ability to propel yourself and the <strong>bubble-gun</strong> ability to trap things in bubbles. With a bit of practice, these powers will let you find your own way to traverse the landscape and solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funky and unique platforming with bubbles, boosts, bouncing and slopes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, light-hearted sprinkle of humour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artwork and soundtrack created by the developer, Jole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret collectibles to find such as trinkets\u00a0and health power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus content designed for those looking to get more out of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of cats (sometimes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wishlist the game today and follow on social media!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valerie is a 2D adventure game by Jole that mixes lively retro-inspired platforming with a personal story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/1d9f76d281eb132cc793e353f275c1ec.avif?t=1755131282\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Unbound Mind\u00a0</i>was a book that sparked great controversy; many who read it mistakenly believed it had opened their mind to paranormal powers. Very few truly grasped its rigorous teachings, but from those who did, <strong>The Unbound Society</strong> was formed - a small elite group with ambitious ideals and intent to impose greater order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows a girl named Valerie who was able to attain these powers, but was separate from those ideals. Her mother, wishing to realise the high expectations she had for her daughter, discovers\u00a0<strong>The Unbound Society</strong>, and takes her to them in the hope that they can light the way to Valerie's future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d6577e2b0c64a6f5049681650d4fa720.avif?t=1755131282\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her powers aren't all that useful for fighting, but they're fun! Use the <strong>boost</strong> ability to propel yourself and the <strong>bubble-gun</strong> ability to trap things in bubbles. With a bit of practice, these powers will let you find your own way to traverse the landscape and solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funky and unique platforming with bubbles, boosts, bouncing and slopes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, light-hearted sprinkle of humour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artwork and soundtrack created by the developer, Jole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret collectibles to find such as trinkets\u00a0and health power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus content designed for those looking to get more out of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of cats (sometimes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wishlist the game today and follow on social media!</i></p>",
